questions.question:
What will this component show after the button is clicked once?

```javascript
function Counter() {
  const [count, setCount] = useState(0);

  return (
    <button onClick={() => setCount(count + 1)}>
      {count}
    </button>
  );
}
```

What is wrong with this code?

```javascript
function Counter() {
  let count = 0;

  return (
    <button onClick={() => count = count + 1}>
      {count}
    </button>
  );
}
```
